{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"山﨑怜奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのうは大学の入学式でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/04/02/7284912/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は朝からお仕事に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ参加させていただき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのままの足で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入学式へ行きました(^L^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから朝からいつもの楽屋に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーツ姿でいることに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく違和感があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと暑いな～と思っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか上着を脱げなかったです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の衣装に着替えたときの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホッとした感じったらもう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ制服のほうが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"居心地良いな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生というラベルが剥がれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目だからかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現状、スーツを着てるというより"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着られてる感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか慣れるといいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入学したはいいものの、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ何も分かっていません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜初めて決まったこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからガイダンス等で決まること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからないことだらけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々と先行き不透明(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンと来ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく不器用だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焦ったり先走ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かと思えば周りの変化に気づけなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空回りしたりしがちだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一歩一歩着実に進めるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分らしく地道に努力して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"積み重ねていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/04/02/7284912/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短めですが一先ずこれで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取り急ぎ、無事に入学したよ～という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご報告でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またすぐにブログ更新します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れな"}],"source":"archive"}